                           skos:definition "The calculated amount representing the portion of parental income and assets considered available to help pay for the student's college education, as determined under the 2025-26 Student Aid Index (SAI) and Pell Grant Eligibility Guide." ;
                           prov:wasDerivedFrom data:USA_UNIT_00184 .


